            "CVE-2024-51751": {
                "cve_id": "CVE-2024-51751",
                "title": "Gradio is an open-source Python package designed to enable quick  ...",
                "description": "Gradio is an open-source Python package designed to enable quick builds of a demo or web application. If File or UploadButton components are used as a part of Gradio application to preview file content, an attacker with access to the application might abuse these components to read arbitrary files from the application server. This issue has been addressed in release version 5.5.0 and all users are advised to upgrade. There are no known workarounds for this vulnerability.",
